rustc_codegen_js: mark exact native semantic adapters.

The backend recognizes native standard-library operations from rustc semantic
identities, never from source paths or generated symbol names. `Extend` is not
a lang item or diagnostic item in the pinned standard library, so give its
required method a private compiler-owned marker in the sysroot sources. The
formatting adapter markers identify the exact default `Write::write_fmt` method
and its sized specialization without interpreting diagnostic paths.
The string marker identifies the exact generic `Display`-based fallback used
by `ToString` so a monomorphic numeric implementation can be recognized.

